WEBVTT

00:00:21.796 --> 00:00:24.566
Let's go and don't cry, funny

00:00:24.566 --> 00:00:27.502
Give me a dumbass dream, please

00:00:27.502 --> 00:00:29.738
Don't touch me, baby

00:00:29.738 --> 00:00:32.941
Freedom, baby

00:00:32.941 --> 00:00:38.847
I'm elastic, I want to be chained

00:00:38.847 --> 00:00:43.451
Can you feel it? The nonsensical afterimage

00:00:43.451 --> 00:00:55.196
Even the moments of points and lines
disappear after failing to show

00:00:55.196 --> 00:01:00.936
The sad forefront, an empty sensation

00:01:00.936 --> 00:01:06.608
Sweet remnants that tear at my heart

00:01:06.608 --> 00:01:12.280
Scattering Polaroids, gathering paranoia

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:17.452
I want you to tell me whose turn is next

00:01:17.452 --> 00:01:30.820
If you sleep close to this incomplete
form, you'll understand and see

00:01:42.644 --> 00:01:47.582
Amanda, you're off the
mission for the time being.

00:01:47.582 --> 00:01:52.120
You have personal ties to Yellow,
the Amalgam that fled with Blue.

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:54.189
Need I say more?

00:01:54.189 --> 00:01:55.824
No, sir.

00:01:55.824 --> 00:01:58.827
But we're short-handed now.

00:01:58.827 --> 00:02:02.630
You can recheck the data
on Blue and Yellow for a while.

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:05.633
Understood.

00:02:05.633 --> 00:02:08.737
The rest of you will continue
to search for Blue and Yellow.

00:02:08.737 --> 00:02:10.637
Understood!

00:02:30.892 --> 00:02:34.662
I hear her brother turned into an Amalgam?

00:02:34.662 --> 00:02:37.699
- Yeah.
- What a shame...

00:02:37.699 --> 00:02:39.634
But she's pretty calm about it.

00:02:39.634 --> 00:02:43.171
Apparently they're not real
brother and sister. She adopted him.

00:02:43.171 --> 00:02:44.832
Oh?

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:52.675
Yes. I'm calm. Even after
what's happened to Malek...

00:02:58.553 --> 00:03:00.321
- Malek is?!
- Yes.

00:03:00.321 --> 00:03:02.824
- How?!
- We don't know.

00:03:02.824 --> 00:03:06.828
I can only assume he came
into contact with one somewhere...

00:03:06.828 --> 00:03:08.489
Contact?

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:15.492
No... Don't tell me that's how he...!

00:03:17.005 --> 00:03:21.943
In any case, with Amanda
off the team, we're short-handed.

00:03:21.943 --> 00:03:23.912
The boss wants you to go after Blue...

00:03:23.912 --> 00:03:25.180
Hermann?!

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:28.516
Damn it! If that's what caused it,

00:03:28.516 --> 00:03:31.152
then I'll never be able to face Amanda again!

00:03:31.152 --> 00:03:33.021
Why only Malek?!

00:03:33.021 --> 00:03:36.891
I can't let the same thing that
happened to Gerd happen to him!

00:03:36.891 --> 00:03:38.552
Damn it!

00:04:03.485 --> 00:04:07.188
Apparently they're not real brother and sister.

00:04:07.188 --> 00:04:14.295
But... Malek had the
same look in his eyes I did...

00:04:14.295 --> 00:04:15.626
Malek...

00:04:37.485 --> 00:04:41.222
Sheesh! All he ever does is bring misfortune!

00:04:41.222 --> 00:04:43.656
Though I guess Joseph will be Joseph.

00:04:45.693 --> 00:04:48.897
Is... Joseph going to die?

00:04:48.897 --> 00:04:54.669
Probably not. But it's much
more likely that XAT will find you.

00:04:54.669 --> 00:05:00.241
Though it doesn't look like
he'll be able to move any time soon.

00:05:00.241 --> 00:05:03.945
I have no choice.
I'll have to leave for a while.

00:05:03.945 --> 00:05:09.851
Even if Joseph gives up,
we can't let XAT find this GARM.

00:05:09.851 --> 00:05:16.624
This is your fault, so you
can handle the rest on your own.

00:05:16.624 --> 00:05:20.595
Take care of your beautifully-fallen body, too.

00:05:20.595 --> 00:05:22.495
Well, bye!

00:05:37.145 --> 00:05:39.670
You're all rotten!

00:05:41.316 --> 00:05:46.154
So what do you say we play a judgment game?

00:05:46.154 --> 00:05:48.850
It was your favorite game, remember?

00:05:50.692 --> 00:05:54.395
I... punished them justly!

00:05:54.395 --> 00:05:58.366
Is that justice for the wicked?

00:05:58.366 --> 00:06:02.598
All I see is him suffering.

00:06:08.876 --> 00:06:12.380
- Eyewitness reports on Cathedral Street!
- Possible sighting in Erdinger District!

00:06:12.380 --> 00:06:14.582
Also spotted by cameras in Diebelz District!

00:06:14.582 --> 00:06:19.144
We'll analyze all live camera feeds
here, so please route them to us!

00:06:29.297 --> 00:06:31.733
Boss, are you still feeling ill?

00:06:31.733 --> 00:06:33.301
No...

00:06:33.301 --> 00:06:35.536
Have you gotten a hold of Hermann yet?

00:06:35.536 --> 00:06:39.340
No, not since he rushed out of HQ...

00:06:39.340 --> 00:06:41.308
Damn him...

00:06:54.022 --> 00:06:55.823
Still a peeping Tom, huh?

00:06:55.823 --> 00:06:58.326
N-No... This isn't...!

00:06:58.326 --> 00:07:03.164
I'm looking for someone.
Think you can help me out?

00:07:03.164 --> 00:07:06.099
Unless you want an ass-kicking...

00:07:13.741 --> 00:07:17.472
It's only a matter of time until you're found...

00:07:23.584 --> 00:07:25.245
Joseph...

00:07:27.188 --> 00:07:33.394
Do you still not understand
that the world must change?

00:07:33.394 --> 00:07:38.093
You haven't changed a bit since that day...

00:07:58.353 --> 00:08:00.014
Are you okay?

00:08:09.464 --> 00:08:15.503
I'm like you now. I'm on the
side that punishes the wicked.

00:08:15.503 --> 00:08:17.739
Y-You have it all wrong...

00:08:17.739 --> 00:08:23.444
I'm not wrong! I avenged
my friend! I avenged Johann!

00:08:23.444 --> 00:08:26.607
They deserved to die!

00:08:27.782 --> 00:08:35.723
So... do you really feel satisfied now?

00:08:35.723 --> 00:08:39.386
I do! It felt great!

00:08:46.067 --> 00:08:51.539
Malek... Think hard about this...

00:08:51.539 --> 00:08:57.211
There wasn't a single life
that you were right to take...

00:08:57.211 --> 00:09:03.551
And what about them?! They pretty
much killed Johann themselves!

00:09:03.551 --> 00:09:08.011
Even so... Even so!

00:09:12.794 --> 00:09:14.421
Malek...

00:09:39.353 --> 00:09:42.190
No...

00:09:42.190 --> 00:09:43.851
No!

00:09:45.760 --> 00:09:51.596
I'm... I'm not wrong!

00:09:53.034 --> 00:09:55.229
I'm not wrong...

00:10:06.013 --> 00:10:10.814
Malek never looked this way at home...

00:10:12.153 --> 00:10:15.556
I first met Malek

00:10:15.556 --> 00:10:20.687
when I visited my aunt's orphanage
for the first time in a while...

00:10:22.864 --> 00:10:24.999
Oh, him?

00:10:24.999 --> 00:10:28.669
He arrived just recently. His name is Malek.

00:10:28.669 --> 00:10:31.038
His parents died in a car accident.

00:10:31.038 --> 00:10:33.529
He's in the same situation you were in.

00:10:35.343 --> 00:10:38.980
Malek had the same
look in his eyes that I had...

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:42.717
My parents died and left me all alone...

00:10:42.717 --> 00:10:45.353
And I desperately tried
to endure the loneliness

00:10:45.353 --> 00:10:48.151
that felt as if the whole
world had abandoned me...

00:10:51.926 --> 00:10:55.630
I visited the orphanage again and again

00:10:55.630 --> 00:11:01.903
and finally convinced my aunt
that I wasn't too young to adopt him.

00:11:01.903 --> 00:11:04.438
You really haven't changed at all.

00:11:04.438 --> 00:11:06.774
There's no talking you out of what you want.

00:11:06.774 --> 00:11:12.847
But it is true that my hands are
too full to give him a fulfilling life...

00:11:12.847 --> 00:11:18.808
I'll try my very best. I will make him happy!

00:11:20.555 --> 00:11:23.925
Amanda, love is all he needs.

00:11:23.925 --> 00:11:27.428
Please show him love.

00:11:27.428 --> 00:11:33.801
I couldn't just ignore Malek.
He had the same look in his eyes I did.

00:11:33.801 --> 00:11:39.433
I thought I could support him
the same way my aunt supported me.

00:11:40.908 --> 00:11:42.705
I wanted to help him...

00:11:44.579 --> 00:11:47.104
I thought I could help him...

00:11:58.926 --> 00:12:01.662
You aren't alone.

00:12:01.662 --> 00:12:03.789
You'll be all right now.

00:12:12.573 --> 00:12:16.277
Yes... You aren't alone.

00:12:16.277 --> 00:12:21.082
Nor am I...

00:12:21.082 --> 00:12:24.819
"I'll make him happy," huh...

00:12:24.819 --> 00:12:27.379
I bought him new clothes...

00:12:28.623 --> 00:12:30.989
Enrolled him in school...

00:12:32.793 --> 00:12:35.921
And felt like I was keeping him safe...

00:12:38.899 --> 00:12:40.696
How stupid could I be?!

00:12:42.536 --> 00:12:44.572
I was only satisfying myself!

00:12:44.572 --> 00:12:49.977
Love is all he needs. Please show him love.

00:12:49.977 --> 00:12:53.247
I... wasn't able to...

00:12:53.247 --> 00:12:57.852
This isn't going to be easy
for us, but let's both try our best!

00:12:57.852 --> 00:13:02.023
I wasn't able to do it...

00:13:02.023 --> 00:13:05.259
I will keep you safe.

00:13:05.259 --> 00:13:07.352
I wasn't able...

00:13:08.829 --> 00:13:12.033
No, there is something I can do!

00:13:12.033 --> 00:13:14.501
I won't let Malek die!

00:13:16.003 --> 00:13:17.738
- This is Hermann.
- Lt's me!

00:13:17.738 --> 00:13:22.209
Amanda, I heard about Malek.
It's my fault that...

00:13:22.209 --> 00:13:26.113
I need your help! I want to
find Malek before XAT does!

00:13:26.113 --> 00:13:29.517
Otherwise, he'll be killed!

00:13:29.517 --> 00:13:32.987
We'll be disobeying orders,
but you're the only one I can turn to.

00:13:32.987 --> 00:13:36.023
Disobeying orders is my specialty.

00:13:36.023 --> 00:13:37.024
That's not what l...

00:13:37.024 --> 00:13:42.229
You can count on me.
Come to 126 Krombacher Street.

00:13:42.229 --> 00:13:44.823
I think I might have a lead.

00:13:59.113 --> 00:14:01.515
Who's there?!

00:14:01.515 --> 00:14:03.818
If you're XAT, stay away!

00:14:03.818 --> 00:14:06.184
If you come any closer, I'll...!

00:14:19.467 --> 00:14:24.739
W-What the...?! It's like the
air here suddenly changed!

00:14:24.739 --> 00:14:26.604
Who is this person?!

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:33.041
S-Stop! Don't come any closer!

00:14:36.550 --> 00:14:38.211
Stop!

00:14:43.891 --> 00:14:47.962
I never wanted to see
you in such deplorable shape...

00:14:47.962 --> 00:14:53.300
Joseph, I never imagined
that you were this foolish.

00:14:53.300 --> 00:14:56.904
In one sense, I had high hopes for you.

00:14:56.904 --> 00:15:02.710
But you leave me no choice.
You need even further motivation.

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:06.373
Allow me to give it to you personally!

00:15:08.783 --> 00:15:10.785
Keep your hands off Joseph!

00:15:10.785 --> 00:15:12.446
Oh?

00:15:14.855 --> 00:15:18.058
Leave this place!

00:15:18.058 --> 00:15:19.860
What an uninteresting make.

00:15:19.860 --> 00:15:24.632
Beatrice needs to be more
thoughtful about whom she gives blood to.

00:15:24.632 --> 00:15:29.470
But perhaps you do show enough
promise to warrant Joseph's support.

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:32.030
Leave now!

00:15:35.442 --> 00:15:37.044
Xargin?!

00:15:37.044 --> 00:15:39.740
Malek! Stop!

00:15:52.726 --> 00:15:54.762
Why?!

00:15:54.762 --> 00:15:56.423
Malek...

00:15:57.398 --> 00:15:58.866
Pathetic.

00:15:58.866 --> 00:16:03.166
S-Stop! Xargin!

00:16:30.998 --> 00:16:33.796
- What was that?!
- Let's go!

00:16:37.872 --> 00:16:48.682
W-Why? It was so easy last time...

00:16:48.682 --> 00:16:50.718
Malek...

00:16:50.718 --> 00:16:53.087
Now, then.

00:16:53.087 --> 00:16:56.955
You're next, Joseph.

00:17:03.030 --> 00:17:07.234
Oh? I'm impressed you
can stand in your condition.

00:17:07.234 --> 00:17:10.704
Perhaps there still is a chance for you?

00:17:10.704 --> 00:17:18.312
Xargin... Your old self
would never have done this!

00:17:18.312 --> 00:17:22.383
It's all so that the world can be reborn.

00:17:22.383 --> 00:17:24.285
You're just arrogant...

00:17:24.285 --> 00:17:32.159
Nobody... wants that... Not even my sister!

00:17:32.159 --> 00:17:36.858
It all started on that day, most likely...

00:17:57.785 --> 00:17:59.446
Xargin!

00:18:03.357 --> 00:18:05.292
Joseph...

00:18:05.292 --> 00:18:10.229
What I seek isn't this lowly.

00:18:14.902 --> 00:18:18.065
It isn't this!

00:18:36.323 --> 00:18:38.125
Joseph.

00:18:38.125 --> 00:18:44.665
If you're able to recover from
this and stand before me once more,

00:18:44.665 --> 00:18:48.802
who knows, you just
might become the Chosen One.

00:18:48.802 --> 00:18:52.006
Let's gamble on that minute possibility.

00:18:52.006 --> 00:18:55.806
For Sasha, your sister's, sake too...

00:19:08.355 --> 00:19:10.721
M-Malek...

00:19:16.263 --> 00:19:18.697
Amanda! Over there!

00:19:20.868 --> 00:19:22.536
Malek!

00:19:22.536 --> 00:19:24.471
Finally found you, Blue!

00:19:24.471 --> 00:19:29.610
- Hermann! Get a transport chopper!
- Right!

00:19:29.610 --> 00:19:33.647
Malek! Hang in there! We'll
get you to the hospital right away!

00:19:33.647 --> 00:19:39.853
Get away, Amanda... My blood...

00:19:39.853 --> 00:19:45.059
That doesn't matter!
I absolutely won't let you die!

00:19:45.059 --> 00:19:47.428
Amanda...

00:19:47.428 --> 00:19:56.470
I... really hated... killing them...

00:19:56.470 --> 00:20:02.476
Even though they... bullied Johann...

00:20:02.476 --> 00:20:08.549
At first... it felt good...

00:20:08.549 --> 00:20:13.620
But then... I suddenly hated it...

00:20:13.620 --> 00:20:18.725
My hands... were covered in blood...

00:20:18.725 --> 00:20:23.697
And... I couldn't help Joseph either...

00:20:23.697 --> 00:20:31.105
I guess I am a weakling after all...

00:20:31.105 --> 00:20:36.877
That's not true... That's not true at all...

00:20:36.877 --> 00:20:46.019
I'm sorry, Malek.
I wasn't there to help you at all...

00:20:46.019 --> 00:20:50.591
Even though you were hurting so much...

00:20:50.591 --> 00:20:52.889
Amanda...

00:20:59.967 --> 00:21:04.461
Malek? Malek?

00:21:06.340 --> 00:21:08.604
Malek!

00:21:47.114 --> 00:21:54.988
The ever-flowing songs search my memory

00:21:54.988 --> 00:22:07.100
The pain etched out by the
times slowly brings me back

00:22:07.100 --> 00:22:10.337
Embrace the sadness

00:22:10.337 --> 00:22:17.778
I know, the days that have passed by

00:22:17.778 --> 00:22:22.282
When I look up, it doesn't spill down

00:22:22.282 --> 00:22:28.855
As it trickles down the window,
sad rain rattles the heated isolation

00:22:28.855 --> 00:22:34.228
Tonight I will be forsaken by sleep

00:22:34.228 --> 00:22:42.035
It's almost as if I'm traveling
to a country no one's ever heard of

00:22:42.035 --> 00:22:48.375
I'm all alone, and my words
don't get through to anyone

00:22:48.375 --> 00:22:50.444
Wow wow

00:22:50.444 --> 00:22:58.452
Now my heart is frozen and waiting

00:22:58.452 --> 00:23:05.551
because it wants a phone
call so it can connect with you

00:23:13.000 --> 00:23:17.838
Without even time for crying,
things progress steadily forward.

00:23:17.838 --> 00:23:23.110
New allies, new enemies,
and a trap of betrayal.

00:23:23.110 --> 00:23:26.713
Episode 10: "Inside the Conspiracy."

00:23:26.713 --> 00:23:30.877
The plans of the unseen are
woven strands of deep darkness.
